1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,000
Singapore runs on one point six million foreign workers.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Not one of them can

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,400
save into the city’s pension, CPF.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,800
Every month, they send money home.

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,600
Back home, their parents have no pension either.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,600
Only one in four older

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,000
people in South Asia receives one.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,800
When the work stops, the money stops.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:25,800
Tonti:

10
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,400
a pension pool that pays an income for life,

11
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,400
running entirely on Robinhood Chain.

12
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,800
Ask what any worker would ask:

13
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,000
how much would my mother get, every month,

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,400
for the rest of her life?

15
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,600
A contract on the chain simulates five hundred

16
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:48,200
and twelve futures and answers in about a second.

17
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,600
Sixty-seven dollars a month, for life.

18
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,800
Saved alone, it would run out at eighty-one,

19
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,600
with even odds she is still alive.

20
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,200
Nothing is precomputed.

21
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,200
Here is the exact call.

22
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,600
Re-run it on a public node,

23
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,000
and you get the same answer.

24
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:12,800
Members are pooled by country, sex and birth year:

25
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,800
eighteen hundred and forty-six cohorts,

26
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:18,400
priced from United Nations life tables and sealed on-chain.

27
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:22,000
Savings are invested in the S and P 500,

28
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,600
Treasury bills and U-S-D-G.

29
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,200
When a member dies,

30
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,600
the savings they put at risk

31
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:30,000
are shared among those still alive.

32
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,600
That is what makes the income last a lifetime.

33
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,400
We replayed history:

34
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:41,600
two thousand Filipino women retiring in nineteen sixty-five,

35
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:44,000
through the real markets that followed.

36
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,600
Drawn alone, their savings ran out in nineteen seventy-seven,

37
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:50,000
with half of them still alive.

38
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,800
The pool paid every one of them,

39
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,200
for as long as they lived.

40
00:01:58,167 --> 00:02:00,567
And it is live on mainnet.

41
00:02:00,567 --> 00:02:03,367
Our first member joined from an iPhone.

42
00:02:03,367 --> 00:02:05,767
Proof of life is a passkey:

43
00:02:05,767 --> 00:02:08,567
one Face ID tap every three months,

44
00:02:08,567 --> 00:02:10,567
verified by the chain itself.

45
00:02:10,567 --> 00:02:12,167
Twenty-five U-S-D-G went in,

46
00:02:12,167 --> 00:02:14,967
and the first monthly settlement invested it:

47
00:02:14,967 --> 00:02:18,567
about fifteen dollars in the S and P 500,

48
00:02:18,567 --> 00:02:21,367
seven in Treasury bills, three in cash.

49
00:02:21,367 --> 00:02:24,967
Every number here is read straight from the chain.

50
00:02:31,167 --> 00:02:34,367
Nobody can take the pot, not even us.

51
00:02:34,367 --> 00:02:35,967
The tables are sealed.

52
00:02:35,967 --> 00:02:39,167
Every rule change waits forty-eight hours in public.

53
00:02:39,167 --> 00:02:42,767
A false death report is answered by one check-in,

54
00:02:42,767 --> 00:02:46,367
and any death can be undone for five years.

55
00:02:46,367 --> 00:02:49,567
We planted fifty-nine bugs in our own contracts;

56
00:02:49,567 --> 00:02:51,567
the tests caught every one.

57
00:02:53,167 --> 00:02:55,167
In English, and in Filipino.

58
00:02:55,167 --> 00:02:55,567
Habambuhay:

59
00:02:55,567 --> 00:02:56,367
for life.

60
00:02:56,367 --> 00:02:58,767
Ask it about your own mother,

61
00:02:58,767 --> 00:03:01,167
at tonti-life dot vercel dot app.
